WEBVTT

00:01:28.497 --> 00:01:30.997
There's a lot of money
to be made in Africa.

00:01:31.430 --> 00:01:34.263
And I think if you're a company

00:01:34.297 --> 00:01:38.197
and you don't figure out
how to get into Africa now,

00:01:38.230 --> 00:01:39.663
in the right way,

00:01:39.697 --> 00:01:41.397
you might sadly miss the window.

00:01:41.897 --> 00:01:47.197
So let me help you by debunking
some of these myths

00:01:47.230 --> 00:01:51.530
and misunderstandings
around Africa and its citizens.

00:01:51.563 --> 00:01:53.263
The first myth:

00:01:53.297 --> 00:01:54.897
Africans are cheap.

00:01:55.830 --> 00:02:00.163
Maybe it's because of my continent's
legacy of poverty and famine